data: {"status":"complete","stop_reason":"stop","error":null,"final_text":"- YOLO reframes object detection as a single regression problem, from image pixels straight to bounding boxes and class probabilities [b1].\n- The image is divided into an S × S grid; each cell predicts B boxes with confidence scores and C conditional class probabilities [b9].\n- One convolutional network with 24 layers followed by 2 fully connected layers is trained end to end on the detection loss [b11].\n- The base model runs at 45 fps and Fast YOLO at 155 fps, far faster than R-CNN-style pipelines [b8].\n- YOLO makes more localization errors than Fast R-CNN but fewer background false positives [b13, b14].\n- Its main limitation is small objects that appear in groups, because each grid cell predicts only two boxes and one class [b12].","handles_seen":["b1","b2","b3","b4","b5","b6","b7","b8","b9","b10","b11","b12","b13","b14"],"markers":["b1","b9","b11","b8","b13","b14","b12"],"usage_totals":{"input":13557,"output":477,"cache_read":5440,"cache_write":0,"reasoning":157,"cost_usd_est":0.003049},"tool_calls":3,"turns":3,"retries":0,"first_text_ms":9163,"latency_ms":12881,"entries":[{"type":"message","id":"c7d10e01","parentId":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-25T15:12:03.004Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Summarise this paper."}],"timestamp":1790350323004}},{"type":"message","id":"c7d10e02","parentId":"c7d10e01","timestamp":"2026-09-25T15:12:04.911Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d101","name":"get_outline","arguments":{}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":2210,"output":71,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":33,"totalTokens":2281,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.000603}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1790350324911}},{"type":"message","id":"c7d10e03","parentId":"c7d10e02","timestamp":"2026-09-25T15:12:05.050Z","message":{"role":"toolResu